{#
  BeMart shared ADMIN LOGIN-CONTEXT layout.

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `login_frame.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/login_frame.twig).

  EC-CUBE's admin UI has TWO frames: the standard `default_frame.twig`
  (sidebar + header bar + content area — ported as `admin-base.html.twig`)
  and a much smaller `login_frame.twig` used by the unauthenticated
  login-context pages (login / 2段階認証チャレンジ / 2段階認証デバイス登録).
  This file is the port of that login frame; the top-level login-context
  pages do `{% extends 'admin-login-base.html.twig' %}`.

  Same port standard as `admin-base.html.twig` (see var/templates/README.md,
  "Admin pages"): keep EC-CUBE's markup skeleton and `c-*` class names
  verbatim; only the EC-CUBE-runtime bindings are rebound.

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (documented; see README "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ '...'|trans }}`  -> the Japanese literal the key resolves to in
     messages.ja.yaml. The chrome labels (the page <title>, the
     `admin.login.enable_javascript` noscript message) are inlined as ja
     literals.
   - `asset('x', 'admin'|'bundle')` -> static URL (`BeMartTwigExtension`).
     The asset PACKAGE argument is KEPT — see `admin-base.html.twig`.
   - `{{ BaseInfo.shop_name }}` in the <title> -> BeMart has no BaseInfo
     entity; the shop name is the page's `shop_name` var (default
     `BeMart`). EC-CUBE-runtime only — enumerated as residual.
   - `{{ include('@admin/alert.twig') }}` -> EC-CUBE flash-message
     partial. BeMart has no flash bag; the include is dropped exactly as
     `admin-base.html.twig` drops it. The render-diff test serves it as
     an empty template so it contributes nothing on either side.
#}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no">
    <title>{{ title|default('ログイン画面') }} - {{ shop_name|default('BeMart') }}</title>
    <meta name="description" content="">
    <meta name="author" content="">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/>
    <link rel="icon" href="{{ asset('assets/img/favicon.ico', 'admin') }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/css/bootstrap.css', 'admin') }}">
    <script src="{{ asset('admin.bundle.js', 'bundle') }}"></script>
</head>
<body id="login-page" class="bg-light">
<noscript>
    <p>JavaScript を有効にしてご利用ください</p>
</noscript>

<div class="c-container">
    <div class="c-contentsArea">

        {% block main %}{% endblock %}

    </div>
</div>

<script src="{{ asset('assets/js/function.js', 'admin') }}"></script>
<script src="{{ asset('assets/js/bemart-unsupported.js') }}"></script>
{% block javascript %}{% endblock %}
</body>
</html>
